{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dangerous Deal: New Life</strong> <br>A bank heist goes wrong. Captured by the police and dragged into an interrogation room, you are offered a secret deal that changes your fate. You end up in prison\u2026 but that is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling:</strong> From a failed heist to the harsh life behind bars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Environments:</strong> Explore detailed locations such as cell blocks, the workshop, laundry, cafeteria, and the prison yard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Tension:</strong> Face the pressure of guards, the hostility of inmates, and the chaos of SWAT raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience:</strong> Dark lighting, dramatic scenes, and cinematic camera work create an immersive atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>The Dangerous Deal: New Life</strong> offers a single-ending, story-driven experience for players who love heist and prison-themed games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037950?t=1759426125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037950?t=1759426125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037950/dae6b48e87e04352b357e8450285d43540a8c07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759426125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037950/dae6b48e87e04352b357e8450285d43540a8c07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759426125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of crime, imprisonment and escape. \r\nIt includes tense situations, mild violence, and mature narrative elements that may not be suitable for all ages. \r\nThere is no sexual content or explicit gore.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dangerous Deal: New Life</strong> <br>A bank heist goes wrong. Captured by the police and dragged into an interrogation room, you are offered a secret deal that changes your fate. You end up in prison\u2026 but that is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling:</strong> From a failed heist to the harsh life behind bars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Environments:</strong> Explore detailed locations such as cell blocks, the workshop, laundry, cafeteria, and the prison yard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Tension:</strong> Face the pressure of guards, the hostility of inmates, and the chaos of SWAT raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience:</strong> Dark lighting, dramatic scenes, and cinematic camera work create an immersive atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>The Dangerous Deal: New Life</strong> offers a single-ending, story-driven experience for players who love heist and prison-themed games.</p>","developers":["IBRAHIM ARSLAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037950/ca9bcb2561b177743a5f11cb670ac124447e1650/header.jpg?t=1759426125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037950/1899563061/4667f39d52b799db1025c11e8c3cf6eda98ea19d/1757962428/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758304738","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037950/1899563061/4667f39